# Two `let`s of a block that read each other have no order to be computed in (Semantics
# ch. 4, binding groups: a line may read a name bound below it, but values that need each
# other at the build are a cycle). prismc's back end refuses it today ("lines that read
# each other at the build"); the checker should. Written by Claude on the claude-lowering
# branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
use Ui.*

@page: @unit
@page:
    let a = b + 1
    let b = a + 1
    Ui.Label($text=$"{a}")
